{"id":144,"gn":"Pokémon Glaciaire","ft":["Un Pokémon Oiseau légendaire. Il peut provoquer des blizzards en gelant l’humidité de l’air.","Le légendaire oiseau des glaces. On dit qu’il apparaît aux gens perdus dans les sommets.","Artikodin est un Pokémon Oiseau légendaire qui peut contrôler la glace. Le battement de ses ailes gèle l’air tout autour de lui. C’est pourquoi on dit que lorsque ce Pokémon vole, il va neiger.","Un Pokémon oiseau légendaire. L’hiver, il glace la vapeur d’eau contenue dans l’air pour faire de la neige.","On raconte que ses belles plumes bleues sont faites de glace. Sa longue queue flotte au vent lorsqu’il vole au-dessus des monts enneigés.","Il possède le pouvoir de contrôler la glace. Selon les dires, il vivrait sur les sommets recouverts de neiges éternelles."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":0,"24":1,"25":2,"26":2,"31":3,"32":3,"33":4,"34":5},"gr":-1,"cr":3,"hc":80,"bh":35,"eg":["Inconnu"],"gw":"slow","gm":{"swcrown":[0,202],"sw":[2,202],"lgpe":[0,144],"xy":[1,151],"hgss":[0,240],"frlg":[0,144],"c":[0,235],"gs":[0,235],"y":[0,144],"rb":[0,144]},"f":{"144":{"n":"Artikodin","t":["ice","flying"],"s":[90,85,100,95,125,85],"h":1.7,"w":55.4,"a":[[46,0],[81,1]],"ps":[[1,[90,85,100,125,125,85]]],"av":["swcrown","sw","lgpe","xy","hgss","frlg","c","gs","y","rb"],"ls":[{"l":[[16,1],[54,1],[181,5],[115,10],[420,15],[97,20],[246,25],[366,30],[573,35],[355,40],[58,45],[258,50],[542,55],[170,60],[59,65],[329,70]],"m":[19,58,59,63,97,115,129,156,164,173,182,196,201,203,211,214,240,241,258,263,311,333,369,403,413,416,419,496,542],"t":[813,814]},{"l":[[16,1],[420,1],[54,8],[43,16],[243,24],[58,32],[97,40],[115,48],[355,56],[59,64],[143,72]],"m":[19,29,58,59,63,92,115,156,164,182,263,355,369]},{"l":[[355,1],[542,1],[573,1],[366,1],[329,1],[16,1],[181,1],[54,8],[420,15],[170,22],[246,29],[97,36],[58,43],[115,50],[258,57],[366,64],[59,71],[329,78],[355,85],[542,92]],"m":[19,46,58,59,63,92,104,115,156,164,182,201,207,211,214,216,218,237,240,241,249,258,263,332,355,369